{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2021-11-11 03:00:00', 'title': 'JACOBS WINS TWO CZECH REPUBLIC NUCLEAR CONTRACTS', 'text': "DALLAS, NOV. 11, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JACOBS (NYSE:J) HAS WON TWO NEW CONTRACTS TO SUPPORT THE CZECH NUCLEAR SECTOR WITH RADIOACTIVE WASTE MANAGEMENT SERVICES. NATIONAL UTILITY ČEZ HAS SELECTED JACOBS' SIAL® GEOPOLYMER ENCAPSULATION TECHNOLOGY TO\xa0SAFELY SOLIDIFY 250 METRIC TONS OF LOW AND INTERMEDIATE-LEVEL RADIOACTIVE SLUDGE AT THE DUKOVANY NUCLEAR POWER PLANT."}